# ⚠ SCAFFOLD. Never built. The .exe/.dll files here are produced by tools/fetch-engines.mjs.
#
# The engine payload is ~32 MB of third-party binaries. It is fetched into src-tauri/payload and must
# never be committed: it is not ours to keep in source control when an immutable upstream URL plus a
# sha256 already pins it, and GitHub's per-file limits are a poor place to find that out.
src-tauri/payload/

# Rust build output. Huge, machine specific.
src-tauri/target/

# Local scratch and logs if anyone runs the app from a working copy.
scratch/
logs/

# Signing material must never live in the repository, and not in CI either: keep the certificate in a
# secret store and pass it to signtool at release time.
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
